/-!
# The ATLAS permutation model of the first Janko group

`TauCeti.SporadicOrders.J1` is the subgroup of permutations of `Fin 266` generated by the
forward image tables in the ATLAS files `J1G1-p266B0.m1` and `J1G1-p266B0.m2`.
The tables below subtract one from both the source points and their images, and display the
266 images as 19 consecutive rows of 14.

The existing presentation uses left-to-right products, whereas Mathlib composes permutations
right to left. Assigning its generators to the inverses of the two ATLAS permutations satisfies
all five transcribed relators and generates exactly this model. Consequently the presented group
surjects onto the model. No order or simplicity assertion is made here.

## References

* R. A. Wilson, R. A. Parker, J. N. Bray et al., *ATLAS of Finite Group Representations*,
  version 3, <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/spor/J1/>.
* Generator image files:
  <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/J1/mtx/J1G1-p266B0.m1> and
  <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/J1/mtx/J1G1-p266B0.m2>.
-/

public section

